@startuml Enhanced_DSS_Sequence_Diagram
!theme plain

title Enhanced Decision Support System - Complete Workflow Sequence
note over User, Database : "Version 1.2.0 - Enhanced DSS with Critical Competencies and Veto Thresholds"

actor User as "Requesting User"
actor Admin as "Administrator"
actor Talent as "Talent User"
participant TalentRequestController as "Controller"
participant TalentRequestRequest as "Request\nValidation"
participant EnhancedDSS as "Enhanced DSS\nService"
participant BasicDSS as "Basic DSS\nService"
participant TalentRequest as "TalentRequest\nModel"
participant Database as "Database"

== Enhanced Talent Request Creation Flow ==

User -> TalentRequestController: create()
activate TalentRequestController
TalentRequestController -> Database: fetch competencies
TalentRequestController --> User: show create form with critical competency UI
deactivate TalentRequestController

note over User
  User configures:
  - Competency weights (0-100%)
  - Critical competency toggles
  - Veto threshold slider (60-100%)
  - Location preferences
end note

User -> TalentRequestController: store(request)
activate TalentRequestController
TalentRequestController -> TalentRequestRequest: validate()
activate TalentRequestRequest

TalentRequestRequest -> TalentRequestRequest: validateCriticalCompetencyRules()
note right: Business rules:\n- Max 70% critical competencies\n- Valid veto threshold range\n- Weight distribution compliance
TalentRequestRequest -> TalentRequestRequest: validateWeightDistribution()
TalentRequestRequest -> TalentRequestRequest: validateRequiredFields()
TalentRequestRequest --> TalentRequestController: validated data
deactivate TalentRequestRequest

TalentRequestController -> Database: begin transaction
TalentRequestController -> TalentRequest: create()
activate TalentRequest
TalentRequest -> Database: insert talent_requests
TalentRequest -> Database: attach competencies with:\n- weights, critical flags, veto_threshold
TalentRequest --> TalentRequestController: created request
deactivate TalentRequest
TalentRequestController -> Database: commit transaction
TalentRequestController --> User: redirect with success message
deactivate TalentRequestController

== Enhanced DSS Processing Flow ==

Admin -> AdminTalentRequestController: show(talentRequest)
activate AdminTalentRequestController

AdminTalentRequestController -> EnhancedDSS: findAndRankTalents(request, 10)
activate EnhancedDSS

EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: extractRequiredCompetencies()
note right: Extract competencies with:\n- required levels, weights\n- critical flags, veto thresholds

EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: validateWeightDistribution()
note right: Academic compliance:\n- Total ≤ 100%\n- Single competency ≤ 100%\n- Prevent extreme dominance (>90%)

EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: normalizeWeights()
note right: Weight normalization:\nnormalized = (weight/total) × 0.85\nLocation weight: 0.15

EnhancedDSS -> Database: find talents with 'talent' role
Database --> EnhancedDSS: potential talents

EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: filterQualifiedTalents()
note right: Mandatory filtering:\n- Must have all competencies\n- Meet minimum proficiency levels

EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: applyVetoThresholds()
note right: Critical competency veto:\neffective_threshold = required × (veto%/100)\nEliminate talents below threshold

alt Veto threshold violations
    EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: logVetoEliminations()
    note right: Log detailed elimination reasons:\n- Talent ID, competency name\n- Required vs actual levels\n- Veto threshold applied
end

EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: normalizePerformanceValues()
note right: Min-Max normalization:\n(current - min) / (max - min)\nEdge case: if range=0, use requirement-based scoring

EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: calculateEnhancedSAWScores()
note right: Enhanced SAW calculation:\n- Competency scoring (85%)\n- Critical competency bonuses (up to 20%)\n- Location intelligence (15%)\n- Mathematical validation

loop For each qualified talent
    EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: calculateCompetencyScore()
    note right: Weighted sum with critical bonuses

    EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: calculateLocationScore()
    note right: Multi-factor location scoring:\n- Country: 50%, City: 30%, Timezone: 20%\n- Work type adjustments

    EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: calculateFinalSAWScore()
    note right: Final = (Competency × 0.85) + (Location × 0.15)

    EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: calculateConfidenceScore()
    note right: Multi-factor confidence:\n- Coverage, consistency, over-qualification

    alt Top candidates only
        EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: calculateSensitivityScores()
        note right: Robustness analysis:\n- Weight sensitivity\n- Ranking stability
    end
end

EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: sortByScoreDescending()
EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: limitResults(10)
EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: generateMethodologyExplanation()

EnhancedDSS --> AdminTalentRequestController: ranked talents with scores
deactivate EnhancedDSS

== Dual Algorithm Comparison ==

AdminTalentRequestController -> BasicDSS: findAndRankTalents(request, 5)
activate BasicDSS
BasicDSS -> BasicDSS: calculateBasicSAWScores()
note right: Basic SAW without:\n- Veto thresholds\n- Critical bonuses\n- Advanced location scoring
BasicDSS --> AdminTalentRequestController: basic SAW results
deactivate BasicDSS

AdminTalentRequestController -> AdminTalentRequestController: prepareComparisonView()
note right: Side-by-side comparison:\n- Enhanced DSS (10 results)\n- Basic SAW (5 results)\n- Score breakdowns\n- Methodology differences

AdminTalentRequestController --> Admin: enhanced results view with comparison
deactivate AdminTalentRequestController

== Admin Decision Making ==

note over Admin
  Admin reviews:
  - Enhanced DSS rankings
  - Basic SAW comparison
  - Score breakdowns
  - Confidence indicators
  - Methodology explanations
end note

Admin -> AdminTalentRequestController: assign(selectedTalents)
activate AdminTalentRequestController

AdminTalentRequestController -> Database: begin transaction
AdminTalentRequestController -> TalentRequest: assignTalents()
AdminTalentRequestController -> Database: insert talent_request_assignments
AdminTalentRequestController -> Database: update request status to 'pending_talent'
AdminTalentRequestController -> Database: commit transaction

AdminTalentRequestController --> Admin: assignment confirmation
deactivate AdminTalentRequestController

== Talent Response Flow ==

loop For each assigned talent
    Talent -> TalentController: viewAssignment()
    activate TalentController
    TalentController -> Database: fetch assignment details
    TalentController --> Talent: show assignment with project details
    deactivate TalentController

    alt Accept assignment
        Talent -> TalentController: acceptAssignment()
        activate TalentController
        TalentController -> Database: update assignment status to 'approved'
        TalentController --> Talent: confirmation message
        deactivate TalentController
    else Reject assignment
        Talent -> TalentController: rejectAssignment()
        activate TalentController
        TalentController -> Database: update assignment status to 'rejected'
        TalentController --> Talent: rejection recorded
        deactivate TalentController
    end
end

== Error Handling Scenarios ==

alt Weight validation error
    TalentRequestRequest -> TalentRequestRequest: validateWeights()
    TalentRequestRequest --> TalentRequestController: ValidationException
    TalentRequestController --> User: error message with correction guidance
end

alt Critical competency business rule violation
    TalentRequestRequest -> TalentRequestRequest: validateCriticalRatio()
    TalentRequestRequest --> TalentRequestController: ValidationException
    note right: "Maximum 70% of competencies can be critical"
    TalentRequestController --> User: business rule violation message
end

alt No qualified talents after veto
    EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: filterQualifiedTalents()
    EnhancedDSS --> AdminTalentRequestController: empty collection
    AdminTalentRequestController --> Admin: "No talents meet critical requirements" message
end

alt Mathematical validation failure
    EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: validateWeightSum()
    EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: logMathematicalError()
    EnhancedDSS --> AdminTalentRequestController: error with technical details
end

@enduml

Admin -> AdminTalentRequestController: show(request)
activate AdminTalentRequestController
AdminTalentRequestController -> EnhancedDSS: findAndRankTalents()
activate EnhancedDSS

EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: extractRequiredCompetencies()
EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: validateWeightDistribution()
EnhancedDSS -> Database: fetch qualified talents
EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: filterQualifiedTalents()

loop for each talent
    EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: normalizePerformanceValues()
    EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: calculateEnhancedSAWScores()
    EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: calculateLocationCompatibility()
    EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: calculateConfidenceScore()
end

EnhancedDSS -> EnhancedDSS: performSensitivityAnalysis()
EnhancedDSS --> AdminTalentRequestController: ranked talents
deactivate EnhancedDSS

AdminTalentRequestController --> Admin: show request with ranked talents
deactivate AdminTalentRequestController

== Admin Assignment ==

Admin -> AdminTalentRequestController: assign(talent)
activate AdminTalentRequestController
AdminTalentRequestController -> Database: begin transaction
AdminTalentRequestController -> TalentRequest: attachTalent()
activate TalentRequest
TalentRequest -> Database: insert talent_request_assignments
TalentRequest -> Database: update request status
TalentRequest --> AdminTalentRequestController: assignment created
deactivate TalentRequest
AdminTalentRequestController -> Database: commit transaction
AdminTalentRequestController --> Admin: redirect with success
deactivate AdminTalentRequestController

== Talent Response ==

Talent -> TalentController: viewAssignment()
activate TalentController
TalentController -> Database: fetch assignment details
TalentController --> Talent: show assignment
deactivate TalentController

Talent -> TalentController: respondToAssignment(accept/reject)
activate TalentController
TalentController -> Database: update assignment status
TalentController -> Database: update request status if accepted
TalentController --> Talent: redirect with response confirmation
deactivate TalentController

== Direct Talent Request Flow ==

User -> TalentRequestController: createDirect(talent)
activate TalentRequestController
TalentRequestController -> Database: verify talent role
TalentRequestController -> Database: fetch talent competencies
TalentRequestController --> User: show direct request form
deactivate TalentRequestController

User -> TalentRequestController: storeDirect(request, talent)
activate TalentRequestController
TalentRequestController -> TalentRequestController: validate request
TalentRequestController -> Database: begin transaction
TalentRequestController -> TalentRequest: create(status='pending_talent')
activate TalentRequest
TalentRequest -> Database: insert talent_requests
TalentRequest -> Database: immediately assign talent
TalentRequest -> Database: attach competencies
TalentRequest --> TalentRequestController: direct request created
deactivate TalentRequest
TalentRequestController -> Database: commit transaction
TalentRequestController --> User: redirect with success
deactivate TalentRequestController

note over Talent
  Talent receives notification
  and can accept/reject directly
end note

== Error Handling ==

alt Validation Error
    TalentRequestRequest --> TalentRequestController: validation exception
    TalentRequestController --> User: redirect with errors
else Database Error
    Database --> TalentRequestController: exception
    TalentRequestController -> Database: rollback transaction
    TalentRequestController --> User: redirect with error message
else DSS Calculation Error
    EnhancedDSS --> AdminTalentRequestController: calculation exception
    AdminTalentRequestController --> Admin: show error with fallback
end

@enduml
